    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d259">

                <pb facs="0476" n="430" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg430"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/570</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        President Wilson
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 30, 1917</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: I enclose a copy of a
                    communication which was read to me by the Japanese Ambassador on June
                        15th,<anchor n="36" xml:id="d259-f1"/>
                    <pb facs="0477" n="431" xml:id="pg431"/> in which his Government expresses a
                    wish that we should confirm the statement made by Mr. Bryan in March
                        1915.<anchor n="38" xml:id="d259-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>In view of what amounts to a request on the part of that Government I felt that
                    it would be wise to reply and have therefore drafted a communication to be
                    delivered to the Ambassador here, if it meets with your approval.<anchor n="39"
                        xml:id="d259-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p>I also enclose a copy of a telegram received from our Chargé at Tokio<anchor
                        n="40" xml:id="d259-f4"/> in which the word “paramount” appears, to which
                    reference is made in the draft at p. 2a.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
